<title>KENYA: Hundreds of demonstrators take to Nairobi streets.</title>
<headline>Hundreds of demonstrators take to Nairobi streets.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Several hundred supporters of a one-day general strike in Kenya took to the streets of Nairobi, breaking a few shop windows and chanting slogans against President Daniel arap Moi, witnesses said.</p>
<p>They said the youths rampaged through the main city centre at the end of a scantly attended opposition rally called to press the government for constitutional reforms.</p>
</text>
